+# Hub state
 
-This library was generated with [Nx](https://nx.dev).
+Page/component-scoped SignalStores orchestrate stateless services. Catalog state owns lookup progress; configuration state owns versioned records and cancels superseded reads. Printout workflow state owns query/resolved physical Elements, selected codes/IDs, per-code option drafts and independent formats, scoped validation errors, stale versions, navigation and future run/file results. UI controls and DOM behavior remain in feature/shared-ui.
+
+Initial values are cloned once per selected code; deselect/reselect and report navigation retain the draft. Reset options preserves formats. Readiness uses schema validation plus supported formats and a nonempty Element set. Route changes cancel pending work and clear transient state; same-context reload reconciles selected identities and marks changed versions for explicit review. Generation validates the values-only snapshot before delegating to the future adapter. Failed-only retry preserves completed identities; downloads use only ready IDs. No operation automatically replays a failed write.
+
+Generate another set clears both selections, drafts, run, stale versions and errors while retaining the available source context.

