-This library was generated with [Nx](https://nx.dev).
+Project, Position, activity and attachment services delegate to source-neutral gateways. Collection services traverse bounded pages to expose every matching row without visible pagination; changing totals, duplicates and incomplete snapshots fail with reload feedback. Sorting remains server-owned with stable tie ordering.
