-# fabrication-feature
+# Fabrication feature
 
-This library was generated with [Nx](https://nx.dev).
+`FabricationPage` lists batches using the shared workspace/sidebar pattern. Row selection shows a details-only property panel; the Name and Number links open `FabricationBatchPage` at `/hub/fabrication-batches/:batchId`. The app composes the route and resolves its batch breadcrumb.
+
+The inner page displays physical Elements in the main table, with searchable metadata and selection details. Assignment is a one-time addition of eligible existing Elements, not an ongoing Project-to-Batch association. The assignment confirmation uses ConfirmDialog; archive and unassignment use anchored ConfirmPopup. Dialog/Select controls remain behind shared UI. Archived Batch/Project/Position state disables directed mutations; backend eligibility and versions remain authoritative.
+
