-# fabrication-state
+# Fabrication state
 
-This library was generated with [Nx](https://nx.dev).
+`FabricationStore` is provided by each list or batch-inner page. It owns complete matching batch collection/loading, selected Batch detail, mutation progress and sanitized errors. Latest-only list/detail reads cancel stale requests. Forms, search text and selected physical Element ID remain local page interaction state.
+
+Components call the store; the store calls FabricationService and never accesses HTTP or PrimeNG. Successful membership mutations reload the matching list and refresh the detail/version only if that Batch is still selected. A delayed mutation response cannot restore a previously visited Batch after route navigation. Backend eligibility, numbering, audit and optimistic concurrency remain authoritative; failures keep the current form/selection available for correction.

